1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,350
Roz zebra crossing paar karte ho,

2
00:00:02,370 --> 00:00:05,560
par kisi ne nahi bataya ki yeh kabhi poora safed kyun nahi hota?

3
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:07,160
Pehla reason: contrast.

4
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:09,890
Kaali sadak pe safed pattiyan door se chamakti hain,

5
00:00:09,910 --> 00:00:12,860
to driver ko pehle hi dikh jaata hai ki aage log chalenge.

6
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:16,030
Waise India mein gaadiyan zebra crossing pe kam hi rukti hai...

7
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:18,480
par aap yahan ruk kar subscribe kar sakte ho!

8
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:22,050
Doosra reason: poori sadak paint kar dete to baarish mein fislan ho jati.

9
00:00:22,070 --> 00:00:25,580
Pattiya beech me tyre ko grip bhi deti hai, aur paint bhi kam lagta hai.

10
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:27,630
To stripes style nahi, safety hain.

11
00:00:27,650 --> 00:00:30,360
Aise hi facts ke liye subscribe kare Whysplained ko!
